# This is a comment
o: scene name
t: transformation: Position Rotation Scale
gp: goal Position: Position
sp: spawn point: position rotation # there chould be more than one, for multiple players
m: model: string #file path
tex: texture: string #file path or NONE
e: Object that we create

model file path start from objects folder 
texture file path start from texture folder. So if you want to use custom texture this is where you have to put them. 
Textures can also be loaded from the same folder where the model is located at. but does not work with my obj loader only assimp

# Example:
o Test Scene

# Position Rotation
sp 2 1 0 90 0 0
sp -2 1 0 -90 0 0

# Position
gp 8 1 0

STATIC 
# Model_Name Texture_Name POS ROTATION SCALE
e cube uvTest.jpg 0 0 0 0 0 0 20 20 1
e guy NONE 4 1 1 0 0 0 1 1 1

END

DYNAMIC 
# Model_Name Texture_Name POS ROTATION SCALE
e cube uvTest.jpg 0 0 0 0 0 0 20 20 1
e guy NONE 4 1 1 0 0 0 1 1 1

END
